  skos:definition "A reverberation effect abruptly shortened by a gate or similar processing, producing a large ambience followed by a sharp cutoff."@en ;
  skos:scopeNote "Abruptly cut-off reverb; 80s drums."@en ;
  skos:broader sl:SL000662 ;
